0 BLOOM GATE - a four-leaf mechanical iris
0 Name: bloom-gate.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/bloom-gate.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // One hub, one motor A, four40T leaf gears and four24T perimeter idlers.
0 // Saved closed pose. Native A0..-45deg opens the leaves by0..45deg.
0 // 24T gears AND their keyed shafts/bushes start at7.5deg tooth phase.
0 // 3958 leaves use actual6143 four-stud axle adapters, at20LDU height pitches.
0 // Clear optical path through the chassis. Hub and cable remain behind the ring.
0 // Standard geometry is external; no custom parts or invisible joints.
0 // Install45610 hub battery for physical use; it is not a simulator placement.
